.TH TYDE-CTL 1 "February 2026" "Tyde" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tyde_wmctl \- command-line interface for Tyde compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tyde_wmctl
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tyde_wmctl
communicates with a running Tyde compositor via its IPC socket to
query state and perform actions.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Window management
.TP
.B windows \fR[\fB--json\fR]
List all windows. Use \fB--json\fR for machine-readable output.
.TP
.B focus \fIid\fR
Focus the window with the given ID.
.TP
.B close \fIid\fR
Close the window.
.TP
.B minimize \fIid\fR
Minimize the window.
.TP
.B restore \fIid\fR
Restore a minimized window.
.TP
.B maximize \fIid\fR
Maximize the window.
.TP
.B unmaximize \fIid\fR
Restore a maximized window.
.TP
.B fullscreen \fIid\fR
Enter fullscreen.
.TP
.B unfullscreen \fIid\fR
Exit fullscreen.
.TP
.B pin \fIid\fR
Pin window to all desktops.
.TP
.B unpin \fIid\fR
Unpin window.
.TP
.B raise \fIid\fR
Raise window to top.
.TP
.B move-to-desktop \fIid\fR \fIn\fR
Move window to desktop \fIn\fR (0-indexed).
.SS Desktop management
.TP
.B desktop
Show current desktop number and total.
.TP
.B switch-desktop \fIn\fR
Switch to desktop \fIn\fR (0-indexed).
.SS Session
.TP
.B lock
Lock the screen.
.TP
.B logout
Terminate the compositor.
.TP
.B restart
Restart the compositor.
.SS Events
.TP
.B subscribe \fR[\fIevent\fR ...]
Stream events as JSON lines. Available events: windows-state,
desktop-state, notification, volume-change, brightness-change,
keyboard-layout, clipboard-history.
.SS Configuration
.TP
.B config
Show the path to the configuration file.
.SH WINDOW IDS
Window IDs have the format
.I xdg-N
for native Wayland windows or
.I xway-N
for XWayland windows. Use
.B tyde_wmctl windows
to list current IDs.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
# List windows
tyde_wmctl windows

# Focus Firefox
tyde_wmctl focus xdg-3

# Move window to desktop 2
tyde_wmctl move-to-desktop xdg-3 1

# Subscribe to events
tyde_wmctl subscribe windows-state desktop-state

# Lock and switch desktop in one script
tyde_wmctl switch-desktop 0
tyde_wmctl lock
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/tyde-compositor.sock
IPC UNIX socket
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success
.TP
.B 1
Error (connection failed, invalid arguments, etc.)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tyde_compositor (1),
.BR tyde_panel (1),
.BR tyde (5)
.SH AUTHORS
Tyde contributors.
